{'symbol': 'PNC', 'date': '2022-05-02 10:53:00', 'title': 'HARRIS WILLIAMS ADVISES EXCEL FITNESS HOLDINGS ON ITS SALE TO OLYMPUS PARTNERS', 'text': "RICHMOND, VA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HARRIS WILLIAMS, A GLOBAL INVESTMENT BANK SPECIALIZING IN M&A ADVISORY SERVICES, ANNOUNCES IT ADVISED EXCEL FITNESS HOLDINGS (EXCEL FITNESS), A PORTFOLIO COMPANY OF ALTAMONT CAPITAL PARTNERS (ALTAMONT), ON ITS SALE TO OLYMPUS PARTNERS (OLYMPUS). EXCEL FITNESS IS ONE OF THE COUNTRY'S LARGEST PLANET FITNESS FRANCHISEES. THE TRANSACTION WAS LED BY RYAN BUDLONG, ZACH ENGLAND AND GRANT SHIN OF THE HARRIS WILLIAMS CONSUMER GROUP. “THE EXCEL FITNESS TEAM, IN PARTNER"}